		(uuid "04f23897-077d-47f6-8bb8-ee0577a763fa")
	)
	(text "U1401 (TPS62130A) receives FPGA5V5 at AVIN and both PVIN pins. C1402 (10 uF)\nand C1403 (100 nF) bypass the input. CMD_AUX25 drives Q1401; a high command\nenables EN_AUX25. R1401 (100 kOhm) pulls EN low when Q1401 is off. FPGA5V5\nmust be available first."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 65.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0cddfa9a-ae4a-4827-86e8-62dd35b5fa19")
	)
	(text "R1405 (0.02 Ohm) drops 20 mV/A outside feedback. At 3 A, AUX2V5 is about 2.44\nV. R1406 (10 kOhm) bleeds the output. PGR_AUX25 is open drain, pulled to AON\nby R1402 (10 kOhm); use its RAW status only with FPGA5V5 present. The IC\nsupports up to 3 A, subject to thermal and shared-input limits. Current and\nthermal protection are internal."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 141 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "207b1a31-049f-4e10-ba31-7eda9e42dd84")
	)
	(text "RAW: 2.5 V nominal; shunt: 20 mV/A.\nPGR_AUX25: RAW status, pulled up to AON."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76 49.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2533b19c-2891-4889-acae-09687c162336")
	)
	(text "Output voltage setting"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 111.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.9 1.9)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2c6b51b0-7bc0-477a-8502-30f881cbb3e9")
	)
	(text "Enable control"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22 27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(thickness 0.18)
